{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.HeckeEngine","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.HeckeEngine","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing","lean:module:QOU.Interactions.TrefoilVanishing"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_neutron4_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_neutron4_trefoil","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L189-L202","doc":"The 4×neutron e⁻ coefficient computed by the Hecke engine.\n\n4·c_e(𝔫) = −HA² · (q² + q⁻² + 2) = −q⁴ + 2 − q⁻⁴\n\nNo division needed — the result is in ℤ[q, q⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_neutron4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_neutron4","kind":"def","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L178-L187","doc":"The neutron NF: B₃ · (σ₀−½HA) · (σ₀−½HA) · (σ₁−HA).\n\n4×neutron = B₃ · (2σ₀−HA) · (2σ₀−HA) · (σ₁−HA). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_proton4_trefoil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_proton4_trefoil","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L160-L174","doc":"The 4×proton e⁻ coefficient, computed by the Hecke engine.\nThis should equal (q−1)²(q+1)²(q⁸−3q⁶−3q²+1) / q⁶\n(which is 4 times the proton e⁻ coefficient). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_proton4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_proton4","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L149-L158","doc":"The proton NF: B₃ · σ₀ · (σ₀ − ½HA) · (σ₁ − ½HA).\n\nSince ½HA is not in ℤ[q,q⁻¹], we compute 4×proton:\n4×proton = B₃ · σ₀ · (2σ₀ − HA) · (2σ₁ − HA). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_b3_eq_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_b3_eq_witness","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L115-L145","doc":"The Hecke-engine B₃ matches the witness coefficients.\n\nDIAGNOSTIC: the per-Fin-component `simp` chain unfolds enough\n`LaurentPolynomial.T` expressions to trigger a simp loop in\ncurrent Mathlib (`maximum recursion depth reached`).  Closing\nrequires either a `simp only` call with the precise lemma list\nthat does not recurse, or a `decide`-based numerical check.\nSorry retained pending refactor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_b3_trefoil_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_b3_trefoil_zero","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L105-L113","doc":"The e⁻ coefficient of the Hecke-engine-computed B₃ is zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_b3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_b3","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L101-L103","doc":"B₃ = (σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³ as an NF element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_unit2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_unit2","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L92-L99","doc":"(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)² as an NF element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.nf_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.nf_unit","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L88-L90","doc":"σ₀σ₁⁻¹ as an NF element (unit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s1_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s1_inv","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L82-L84","doc":"Right-multiply by σ₁⁻¹ = σ₁ − HA·γ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.mul_right_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.mul_right_id","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L77-L78","doc":"Right-multiply by identity (no-op). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s1","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L65-L75","doc":"Right-multiply NF element by σ₁.\nγ·σ₁ = σ₁,  σ₀·σ₁ = L₊,  σ₁·σ₁ = γ + HA·σ₁,\nL₊·σ₁ = σ₀ + HA·L₊, L₋·σ₁ = e⁻, e⁻·σ₁ = L₋ + HA·e⁻ ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.mul_right_s0","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L50-L63","doc":"Right-multiply NF element by σ₀.\nStructure constants from the Hecke and Yang-Baxter relations:\n  γ·σ₀ = σ₀,  σ₀·σ₀ = γ + HA·σ₀,  σ₁·σ₀ = L₋,\n  L₊·σ₀ = e⁻, L₋·σ₀ = σ₁ + HA·L₋, e⁻·σ₀ = L₊ + HA·e⁻ ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hecke_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hecke_add","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L44-L46","doc":"Addition of NF elements. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hecke_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hecke_smul","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L40-L42","doc":"Scalar multiplication of an NF element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.HeckeNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.HeckeNF","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/HeckeEngine.lean#L37-L38","doc":"An element of H₃(q) in NF: 6 coefficients in ℤ[q, q⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0}]}